{"summary":"古冢中水是古代坟墓中积水，有毒，不可内服。外用可治疗多种疮疡，有杀菌愈疮之效。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"出自《拾遗》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"有毒，杀人。洗诸疮皆瘥（藏器）。","translation":"有毒，能致人死亡。洗涤各种疮疡，都能痊愈（藏器）。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%B0%B4%E9%83%A8#古塚中水","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:36.663Z"}